  "body": [
    "Sail Reply, exclusive service partner of Mistral AI, is a Silver Sponsor of the AI Now Summit organized by Mistral AI on May 28, 2026, at the Carrousel du Louvre in Paris.",
    "From the demo stand to the Build Keynote — Sail Reply will be fully present throughout the day.",
    "OUR PARTNERSHIP",
    "Sail Reply is the Reply group company exclusively dedicated to Mistral AI — designed to conceive, integrate, and manage sovereign AI solutions across the entire enterprise stack. From infrastructure to fine-tuning models, we deliver AI that remains under your control.",
    "As a Mistral Service Partner, we structure the Mistral AI ecosystem to provide businesses with sovereign and secure AI: tailored to their data, compliant with European regulations, and operational at scale.",
    "WHAT WE DEMONSTRATE",
    "Two key themes at our booth, rooted in real production deployments.",
    "Workshop session",
    "28th May",
    "15:55 ( 20 minutes )",
    "Act Stage",
    "Today, any service typically comes with a contact center aiming to resolve escalations/service shortcomings. This is a typical operating model across geographies and industry verticals.We develop bespoke LLMs that master the domain knowledge and the latency requirements for real time service. Interfacing real time customer requests.",
    "Speakers details:",
    "Dimitris Vlitas - Partner at SAIL Reply",
    "Haris Constantinidis - CEO at Mellon Group Technologies",
    "The production line for creating industrial-grade generative AI models.",
    "Three resources to contextualize what we will share at AI Now.",
    "Find us at the Sail Reply booth",
    "We will be present all day on May 28. Sign up and come see us — whether you are curious about sovereign AI, LLM fine-tuning, or the Vienna Academy project."
  ],
